{"title":"2015 OIM Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_OIM_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f32377ac67d94f764f12a15ea987e88c85d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/b/fdb63b9e51abe6bbb16acfb5d7b773ddbb5bf4a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\beta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"10\" height=\"16\" /> be roots of the polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/7/917657adbf8e8059cc85ffd723aebcc94fb92063.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-qx+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is a rational number greater than 2.  We define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/d/d0d0e8de875401588c7f15eba6d1aaac9e0ceac9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1=\\alpha+\\beta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/e/7ae496655b4dded171d28728bc08bf3a6943e868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_1=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, and for each integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/7/317096889b84df0b72bf69ceb4c82208305f1b0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"46\" height=\"16\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/9/209d7e4fa6633f8e0745828869f209151bf94daa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[s_n=\\alpha ^n +\\beta ^n,\\;t_n=s_{n-1}+2s_{n-2}+\\cdots+(n-1)s_1+n\\]\" width=\"429\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Show that for all odd <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/9/2e9bb94664d3e2d8c57a28afbd35f239ab99ef27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is the square of a rational number.\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_OIM_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2015_OIM_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_OIM_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OIM_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"OIM Problems and Solutions\">OIM Problems and Solutions</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018000547\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 66/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1797/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.587      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    5.587      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26234:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018000547 and revision id 207389. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}